      "title": "Adding a Second Route",
      "sourceHash": "d43a9b67f7060acda3edc877747c47ec606e98c06fc61493c7247a62d5126ebc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.14,
          "en": "So let's add more pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.14,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "And for that I'm first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 9.39,
          "en": "of all going to add another component to the pages folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.39,
          "end": 11.25,
          "en": "And I'll name it \"Products JS.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.25,
          "end": 13.77,
          "en": "The name of course is up to you, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.77,
          "end": 15.78,
          "en": "Here I'll add a products page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.78,
          "end": 18,
          "en": "but it will still just be a dummy page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18,
          "end": 22.44,
          "en": "without any actual real content on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.44,
          "end": 25.23,
          "en": "Here I will then return an H-1 element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.23,
          "end": 28.737,
          "en": "where I say \"the products page.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.64,
          "end": 31.53,
          "en": "And with that component added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.53,
          "end": 34.23,
          "en": "we can also add a route for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.23,
          "end": 36.39,
          "en": "We do that by adding a second element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.39,
          "end": 40.02,
          "en": "here to this array of route definitions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.02,
          "end": 43.35,
          "en": "And now the path could be \"slash products.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.35,
          "end": 46.44,
          "en": "It is of course up to you which paths you wanna support.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.44,
          "end": 48.63,
          "en": "But \"slash products\" might be a path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.63,
          "end": 50.28,
          "en": "that makes a lot of sense if",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.28,
          "end": 53.943,
          "en": "we're loading a page that might display some product items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.96,
          "end": 58.35,
          "en": "So therefore, here, we load slash products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.35,
          "end": 63.35,
          "en": "And, as an element, I want to load the products page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.53,
          "end": 67.23,
          "en": "Therefore, we're importing the products page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.23,
          "end": 68.64,
          "en": "and we're using it in our",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.64,
          "end": 72.003,
          "en": "JSX code for this element property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.02,
          "end": 74.22,
          "en": "And that is all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.22,
          "end": 77.55,
          "en": "With that we're supporting this second page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.55,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "for \"slash products,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 82.59,
          "en": "and therefore if we save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.59,
          "end": 85.86,
          "en": "and we go back and we enter \"slash products,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 89.67,
          "en": "after a local host 3000, and hit enter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.67,
          "end": 92.31,
          "en": "we load the products page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.31,
          "end": 94.8,
          "en": "And, of course, hopefully, unsurprisingly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.8,
          "end": 96.63,
          "en": "if we delete \"slash products,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.63,
          "end": 98.82,
          "en": "we load the homepage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.82,
          "end": 101.55,
          "en": "If we enter something totally different,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.55,
          "end": 102.95400000000001,
          "en": "we get an error, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.95400000000001,
          "end": 106.77000000000001,
          "en": "because we try to visit a URL, a path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.77000000000001,
          "end": 108.81,
          "en": "that's not supported yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.81,
          "end": 109.68,
          "en": "Now I'll get back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.68,
          "end": 113.1,
          "en": "to errors and error handling and showing good",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.1,
          "end": 115.71000000000001,
          "en": "error pages instead of this default page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.71000000000001,
          "end": 118.38,
          "en": "that's generated by React-Router-Dom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.38,
          "end": 119.67,
          "en": "a little bit later, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.67,
          "end": 122.46,
          "en": "For the moment, let's just go back to \"slash nothing,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
